gm-method (compact baked heightfield with per-sector min/max quantization): offline-bake fallback for CPU/GPU parity: per-sector min/max + int8 nodes normalized to range -> high res at low bits + small file. Binary .hf codec ~1 byte/node, HeightfieldCodec.js. Two readers (CPU collider + GPU render) stay in agreement by sharing the same baked artifact rather than re-computing independently.